WEBVTT

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:32.121
This all happened 10 years ago,

00:01:32.145 --> 00:01:35.411
and how I handled it
haunted me for a long time.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:38.506
It wasn't the first time
I thought about the word

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.886
in an academic setting.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.688
I'm a professor of US history,

00:01:42.712 --> 00:01:45.609
it's in a lot
of the documents that I teach.

00:01:45.633 --> 00:01:47.366
So I had to make a choice.

00:01:48.561 --> 00:01:50.466
After consulting with someone I trusted,

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.387
I decided to never say it.

00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:53.811
Not even to quote it.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:58.020
But instead to use
the euphemistic phrase, "the N-word."

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:01.558
Even this decision was complicated.